00:00:20.984 --> 00:00:22.556
Everyone's done with rainbows,

00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:24.881
and they want things black as their soul.

00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:25.714
- Got it.

00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:28.964
(upbeat spooky music)

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.579
- [Woman Offstage] You can open your eyes.

