00:00:44.412 --> 00:00:45.524
- [Both] Ooh!

00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:46.570
- That's gorgeous.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.544
- It's so pretty.

00:00:47.544 --> 00:00:49.257
- It is so pretty.

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:50.446
- Whoa!

00:00:50.446 --> 00:00:52.261
- It's almost like gray.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:56.094
- It smells like a latte.
It looks like death.

00:00:56.995 --> 00:00:58.406
This is unsettling for some reason

00:00:58.406 --> 00:00:59.927
I can't quite explain.
- I really like it.

00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:02.983
- It's just coffee but
it looks fucking awesome.

00:01:02.983 --> 00:01:05.426
- It's like I'm gonna
start drinking demon souls.

00:01:05.426 --> 00:01:06.759
- [Both] Cheers.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.954
- [Both] Cheers.

00:01:09.954 --> 00:01:12.261
- The texture is slightly different.

00:01:12.261 --> 00:01:14.374
There's a little bit more graininess.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:18.819
- I mean it's really good.
Tablespoon of charcoal's in this?

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:21.181
- That seems like a lot.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.431
(laughing)

00:01:24.865 --> 00:01:26.113
So I'm going to.
- Yeah.

00:01:26.113 --> 00:01:28.146
