thought this was a blue glass,

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.867
but it's just clear,

00:01:39.867 --> 00:01:42.447
And that's the color that the latte was.

00:01:42.447 --> 00:01:43.637
- Yeah it's amazing.

00:01:43.637 --> 00:01:46.932
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:46.932 --> 00:01:49.422
- We are in a sort of
darker era of history now.

00:01:49.422 --> 00:01:50.682
- The darkest timeline,

00:01:50.682 --> 00:01:52.886
and we now have a coffee to go with it.

00:01:52.886 --> 00:01:57.335
- The thing I like about goth
is just the visual aesthetic.

00:01:57.335 --> 00:01:58.758
Goth food looks cool,

00:01:58.758 --> 00:02:01.561
doesn't really affect the
taste that much to me,

00:02:01.561 --> 00:02:05.788
and I'm all for looking
as cool as I possibly can.

00:02:05.788 --> 00:02:07.463
Just gotta hold on to that.

00:02:07.463 --> 00:02:09.932
- I know people make fun
of uh all the trends of

00:02:09.932 --> 00:02:13.387
like adding food coloring
essentially to everyday foods

00:02:13.387 --> 00:02:15.744
and making them cool, but I would say

00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:18.069
there's nothing wrong with
playing with your food

00:02:18.069 --> 00:02:21.279
and having a good time and
making things visually fun.

00:02:21.279 --> 00:02:24.643
Go, make your food art.
Drink your goth lattes.

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:27.140
- Yeah enjoy your food.
Enjoy how it looks, too.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.489
- Enjoy your life.

00:02:28.489 --> 00:02:31.344
There should be a dark,
like a goth unicorn latte.

00:02:31.344 --> 00:02:32.285
- Goth unicorn
- [Both] Ooh!

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.740
- That would be cool.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.309
- It would like, it
would have like sprinkles

00:02:35.309 --> 00:02:36.528
and like a horn or something
- But they're black.

00:02:36.528 --> 00:02:37.407
- [Both] Yeah

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:38.240
